al_business_count":3}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"KgorjaefL0et2i0YdIN9Jg","review_id":"7Grd8Zsdj0iDMoWacNtdDQ","date":"2014-10-17T22:11:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8953733444213867,"text_excerpt":"Oh so fabulous. We luckily were hot and saw the sign for natural Popsicles. These were the best I've ever had and I've had a killer dulce de leche paleta in Mexico and all kinds of fruity ones in California and Hawaii. Wow. Wow. Wow. I had 2 dairy-based ones. Salted caramel that was delightful and not over-the-top sweet. My second one was dark chocolate with salt and olive oil. What every adult's fantasy of what a fudgesicle could be. Likely one of the best chocolate items I've ever had. My wife had pineapple cilantro - a fantastic refreshing combo that is vegan. Her second one was mayhaw (hawthorn fruit that is a bit tart) with a little bit of chia seeds. $3 for one of the best Popsicles..."},{"business_id":"KgorjaefL0et2i0YdIN9Jg","review_id":"C0Y8wlz2fby7gdaucfkuCw","date":"2015-04-08T18:44:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8952039480209351,"text_excerpt":"The saffron rose water pop was heavenly. So good and the owner couldn't have been nicer. The shop is in a cute location. It is nice to see St. Claude have cool places like this on it these days. It is far and away from my neighborhood, unfortunately, but my work schedule on Wednesday is such that I am totally stopping by here on Wednesdays from now on."},{"business_id":"KgorjaefL0et2i0YdIN9Jg","review_id":"LYu59f6W5qu5JwKp0g5MoA","date":"2015-04-13T00:53:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8750405311584473,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in on a hot day while a second line was moving down St. Claude Ave. I wanted something to cool me off and there is Meltdown. You probably won't know its there unless you stumble upon it or you stop to eat at the sneaky pickle, whatever the case they feature exotic popsicles that are sure to please. A great treat on a hot day if you are in the upper 9/bywater area."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"KgorjaefL0et2i0YdIN9Jg","photo_id":"DDQStAEl6H6Ljx1rWwrbxA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DDQStAEl6H6Ljx1rWwrbxA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
